    {
      "id": "claim_4db15ebe5d0e4942af5d780a2dd2b96c",
      "statement": "The close path is terminal from Sebastian's side: once the issue is closed as not_planned nothing in the process reopens it, and a later `edited` delivery on the closed issue returns at the `IssueState.Open` guard, so only a human re-open plus an edit (or a re-label) produces a delivery that re-enters validation.",
